          {
            "id": "sd_main_title",
            "elType": "widget",
            "widgetType": "heading",
            "settings": {
              "title": "What is Spinal Adjustment?",
              "header_size": "h2",
              "title_color": "#0B2545",
              "typography_font_size": {"size": 30, "unit": "px"},
              "typography_font_weight": "800"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "sd_main_text1",
            "elType": "widget",
            "widgetType": "text-editor",
            "settings": {
              "editor": "<p>Spinal adjustment, also known as spinal manipulation, is a core chiropractic technique used to treat musculoskeletal disorders. The procedure involves applying a controlled, sudden force to a specific joint in the spine, moving it beyond its normal range of motion.</p><p>This treatment helps restore proper alignment, reduce nerve irritability, improve range of motion, and enhance overall physical function. Our chiropractors use precise, gentle techniques tailored to each patient's condition and comfort level.</p>",
              "text_color": "#555555",
              "typography_font_size": {"size": 16, "unit": "px"},
              "typography_line_height": {"size": 1.8, "unit": "em"}
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "sd_benefits_title",
            "elType": "widget",
            "widgetType": "heading",
            "settings": {
              "title": "Key Benefits",
              "header_size": "h3",
              "title_color": "#0B2545",
              "typography_font_size": {"size": 24, "unit": "px"},
              "typography_font_weight": "700"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "sd_benefits_list",
            "elType": "widget",
            "widgetType": "icon-list",
            "settings": {
              "icon_list": [
                {"text": "Pain relief without medication", "selected_icon": {"value": "fas fa-check-circle", "library": "fa-solid"}},
                {"text": "Improved spinal alignment and posture", "selected_icon": {"value": "fas fa-check-circle", "library": "fa-solid"}},
                {"text": "Enhanced range of motion and flexibility", "selected_icon": {"value": "fas fa-check-circle", "library": "fa-solid"}},
                {"text": "Reduced nerve pressure and irritation", "selected_icon": {"value": "fas fa-check-circle", "library": "fa-solid"}},
                {"text": "Better overall physical function", "selected_icon": {"value": "fas fa-check-circle", "library": "fa-solid"}},
                {"text": "Non-invasive and drug-free treatment", "selected_icon": {"value": "fas fa-check-circle", "library": "fa-solid"}}
              ],
              "icon_color": "#13A89E",
              "text_color": "#555555",
              "space_between": {"size": 15, "unit": "px"},
              "typography_font_size": {"size": 16, "unit": "px"}
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "sd_process_title",
            "elType": "widget",
            "widgetType": "heading",
            "settings": {
              "title": "What to Expect",
              "header_size": "h3",
              "title_color": "#0B2545",
              "typography_font_size": {"size": 24, "unit": "px"},
              "typography_font_weight": "700"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "sd_process_text",
            "elType": "widget",
            "widgetType": "text-editor",
            "settings": {
              "editor": "<p>During your first visit, our chiropractor will perform a thorough examination including health history review, physical assessment, and if necessary, diagnostic imaging. Based on the findings, a personalized treatment plan will be created.</p><p>Each adjustment session typically lasts 15-30 minutes. Many patients experience relief after the first session, though a series of treatments is usually recommended for optimal results.</p>",
              "text_color": "#555555",
              "typography_font_size": {"size": 16, "unit": "px"},
              "typography_line_height": {"size": 1.8, "unit": "em"}
            }
          }
        ]
      },
